ng>2.5mm 4 core copper wire</strong> is the recommended choice for safety and performance.\"\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n          \"name\": \"What is the primary difference between 3 core and 4 core AC wire?\",\r\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n            \"text\": \"A <strong>3 core wire</strong> has three conductors: Phase (Live), Neutral, and Earth. A <strong>4 core wire</strong> has an additional conductor, which is often used for communication between the indoor and outdoor units in inverter ACs or for other specific control functions.\"\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Why should I only use pure copper wire for my AC?\",\r\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n            \"text\": \"Pure <strong>copper wire</strong> offers superior electrical conductivity, lower resistance, and better heat dissipation compared to aluminum or CCA wires. This translates to higher energy efficiency, reduced risk of overheating, and a longer, safer lifespan for your air conditioner.\"\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Do you provide AC copper wire near me in Surat or Ahmedabad?\",\r\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n            \"text\": \"Yes! <strong>Atlas Aircon</strong> is headquartered in <strong>Vadodara</strong> and proudly serves numerous cities including <strong>Surat, Ahmedabad, Bharuch, Ankleshwar, Vapi</strong>, and all across <strong>Gujarat</strong>. We provide fast delivery and support for all your AC component needs.\"\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n              \"name\": \"What is the primary difference between 3 core and 4 core AC wire?\",\r\n              \"acceptedAnsw